# Diagrams generated from mermaid/*.mmd. Regenerate with `make diagrams`.
#
# The .svg beside each of these IS committed: it is what the markdown
# references, so the documents render in a fresh clone, in a plain markdown
# viewer, and on GitHub -- none of which run a build.
#
# The .png is only needed by the PDF build, which regenerates it under build/.
# Listed explicitly rather than by glob, so adding a hand-authored PNG here
# does not get ignored by accident.
flight-planner-class-diagram.png
flight-planner-network.png
